WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.365
A shopper wants to browse the shop by brand. Here we open the new Brands page, which shows a card for every brand in the catalog.

2
00:00:08.365 --> 00:00:12.689
The page opens under a clear heading that simply reads Brands.

3
00:00:12.689 --> 00:00:23.977
Below it sits one card for every brand in the catalog, in alphabetical order. The first card is Acme Empty, a brand with no products yet, and it still gets its own card.

4
00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:32.470
The order follows the brand name, not the order in which brands were added: the newer Mono Gear sits right between Legend and Quester.

5
00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:37.721
The list ends with Zephyr, so every brand from A to Z has its place on the page.

6
00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:43.164
Shoppers now see the whole brand lineup at a glance, in an order that is easy to scan.
